{"4393140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Al'ulA", "steam_appid": 4393140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>[This game is a Vertical Slice created by a team of students over the span of about 7 months]</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THINK ✨</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mariam, a Moroccan astronomer, is <strong>trapped in a realm of impossible geometry</strong>. Use your perception of space to navigate shifting staircases, twisting corridors, and <strong>non-euclidean structures where reality no longer follows the rules.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROTATE 🌌</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Artifact to bend the world around you. Select rows of tiles and rotate them in any direction, reshaping the room itself. <strong>Twist corridors, align staircases, and rearrange the environment to reach new paths.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE 👁️</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious Entity brought Mariam into this fractal dimension. Solve puzzle after puzzle with the Artifact, <strong>uncover fragments of Mariam’s past</strong>, and discover the truth behind this impossible place as you <strong>search for a way out</strong>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>[This game is a Vertical Slice created by a team of students over the span of about 7 months]</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THINK ✨</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mariam, a Moroccan astronomer, is <strong>trapped in a realm of impossible geometry</strong>. Use your perception of space to navigate shifting staircases, twisting corridors, and <strong>non-euclidean structures where reality no longer follows the rules.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROTATE 🌌</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Artifact to bend the world around you. Select rows of tiles and rotate them in any direction, reshaping the room itself. <strong>Twist corridors, align staircases, and rearrange the environment to reach new paths.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE 👁️</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious Entity brought Mariam into this fractal dimension. Solve puzzle after puzzle with the Artifact, <strong>uncover fragments of Mariam’s past</strong>, and discover the truth behind this impossible place as you <strong>search for a way out</strong>.</p>", "short_description": "Al’ulA is a first-person non-euclidean puzzle game set in a strange fractal dimension inspired by medieval Morocco. You will use an alien artefact to solve puzzles while guided by a strange alien entity.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“It’s a first-person puzzle game that challenges us to grasp non-Euclidean geometry set in medieval Morocco. As a huge fan of Portal and Outer Wilds, I can't resist when a strange artifact is dangled in front of me and there's a promise of playing with my perception of space.”<br>The Pixel Post<br><br>“A very ambitious puzzle game where you rotate Moroccan-themed rooms from the inside. Escher probably approves.”<br>Omnishambles<br><br>“An innovative concept that places you at the very heart of a Rubik's Cube, set in a atmosphere rarely seen in video games: Medieval Morocco.”<br>Indie 500<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393140/cf77bcd70f089cf47891d74fd041ca9b5f2da3f6/header.jpg?t=1786383033", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393140/1e8c9fc60d5bb0d18b68370c35366733175681ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786383033", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393140/1e8c9fc60d5bb0d18b68370c35366733175681ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786383033", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-9600K / AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  GeForce GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-11700K / AMD Ryzen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 2080<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Astrolabs Entertainment"], "publishers": ["IIM Digital School"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "37", "description": "Free To Play"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393140/742c739ad8207c16a5b4f8585b15884129ac060f/ss_742c739ad